<item>
<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-06T16:04:54.566Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:04:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli President announced on Sunday the person who will attempt to form the next government, while opposition leader Gadi Eisenkot reported progress in coalition talks and faced opposition easing on the ultra-Orthodox draft. Israeli settlers seized eight Palestinian homes in Jericho, displacing dozens, and IDF arrested three Palestinians planning terror attacks in the West Bank. In Gaza, gunfire damaged tents at the Rafah displacement site as aid teams prepared for winter storms, and residents built wind turbines from rubble and turned discarded cooking pots into seawalls. 21,440 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/04/world/middleeast/israel-herzog-netanyahu-government.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168740&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-is-israel-opposition-figure-gadi-eisenkot-going-to-replace-benjamin-netanyahu&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261106-israel-s-eisenkot-claims-significant-progress-in-coalition-talks-as-opposition-eases-on-ultra-orthodox-draft&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261106-israel-president-to-announce-sunday-who-will-form-new-government&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQci1SWVhXeUtGN1B2NWRkR240NU5FVG5Tc1BVOXlzUzlEcGNhaUc0R2hneEphVnM0SDhLQVdEaHRXbk00YVBPTnBmWkFqUnJKZ2x1dmN1MzNxaDdJN3p3NzJlLUgtZzZVMHUxVDd3SU5aU1dnYW5zaXF3bkdhdm5UNGlKSU1pd2E5ODFrUDBQRlpyck96a2tXdGRJQUY4b3FlbWlybHRaY3QyNjZ0S283U0RDcDRScXAySEtuQS1FZWlSd2M1Ymd0aFl3V2tl